  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees.",
    "Butter the bread slices on both sides.",
    "Place the bread slices on a baking sheet and bake for 5 minutes.",
    "While the bread is baking, heat the soy sauce and garlic in a pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped tomatoes to the pan and stir to combine.",
    "Season the tomato mixture with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Remove the bread from the oven and top each slice with the tomato mixture.",
    "Sprinkle the chopped green onions over the top of each slice.",
    "Serve the Yellowed Chinese Tomatoes Toast hot."
